{"title":"2021 JMPSC Sprint Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/3/3b3fdf734d37afcd7368b2c7eb50c8b46737b70c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{1}{9}\\right)(3+6+9)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"201\" height=\"45\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solving the right side gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/a/38ac091b48ac0d16def22ca05ec82cc770e1f979.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 6 + 9 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"113\" height=\"14\" />. Distributing into the left side gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/5/da5441de223b1780f08a1f21624b4881eca97b74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{18}{3}+\\frac{18}{6}+\\frac{18}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/9/809194d73eea9b963f4ad71c472b613f30183c27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + 3 + 2 = \\boxed{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"127\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/7/1c716d67aaff667b437ff3aec54ed1a3ac2ed951.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{1}{9}=\\frac{6}{18}+\\frac{3}{18}+\\frac{2}{18}=\\frac{11}{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"267\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/0/14063eb5ced77559a45fe9f2f21dac22af614d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+6+9=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"113\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/d/fad5e0d86fe9d9b70f84524fb31bba85e0db7efe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{11}{18}\\cdot18=\\boxed{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"109\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/f/44f97729e92610a5e015fa81a9a015f8a5a34f71.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3 \\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right) + 3 \\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right) + 3 \\left(\\frac{1}{9}\\right)=1+\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{11}{6}\\]\" width=\"346\" height=\"43\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/7/647feb8e91745ab15d79b569a6368e0b17464951.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6 \\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right) + 6 \\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right) + 6 \\left(\\frac{1}{9}\\right)=2+1+\\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{22}{6}\\]\" width=\"342\" height=\"43\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/8/7a8321313222ad06f7bdff95ba56225f0f330144.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9 \\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right) + 9 \\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right) + 9 \\left(\\frac{1}{9}\\right)=3+\\frac{3}{2}+1=\\frac{33}{6}\\]\" width=\"342\" height=\"43\" />\nTherefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/0/eb0e495338fd9ba0dd63e00cbf23fc9b157cec01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{11}{6}+\\frac{22}{6}+\\frac{33}{6}=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"155\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>- kante314 -\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>Solution by pog</i>\n</p><p>Recall that, for any nonzero <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd926084c19fc7e111af706032d9480f4c5cb215.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac1a+\\dfrac1b+\\dfrac1c = \\dfrac{\\sum_{\\text{sym}}ab}{abc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"42\" />. By Vieta's, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are the roots of the monic cubic polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e1148c9273c109e894d0821ebb95047b81161ac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[Q(x) = x^3 - px^2 + \\left(\\sum_{\\text{sym}}ab\\right) x - abc,\\]\" width=\"291\" height=\"54\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is an arbitrary constant equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/d/2cdfeae33c1e09de6207d446beb72396c04be481.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>In the given equation, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/b/33b3c27171aba2140505212ce5b912115d1cdd69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/0/b4072cb7de18361e960cfe836e16456d1dd1ae2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 6$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaa469f5533743cf3ed01982d13681820ffaa3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/8/ba836104476a40f980309b7970592d63b3386379.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 3 + 6 + 9 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/0/6a007367b1ff20239c22856abe70e20ea6ef20d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc = 3 \\cdot 6 \\cdot 9 = 162$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"156\" height=\"14\" />, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/1/711b245a00d997eebb80eda90a534e0c9bab92f6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[Q(x) =  x^3 - 18x^2 + \\left(\\sum_{\\text{sym}}ab\\right) x - 162.\\]\" width=\"301\" height=\"54\" /> (Finding the former of the latter two coefficients would lead to bashy casework, which we avoid in this extremely elegant solution.) \n</p><p>Since our cubic has roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the discriminant of our monic cubic polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/9/c7920d079918f293255c59ba7703c3a32411538b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A^2B^2 + 18ABC - 4B^3 - 4A^3C - 27C^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"310\" height=\"18\" /> (where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are the latter three coefficients of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />, respectively--do not confuse them for the roots of our polynomial equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340605c5f88cf6864adc5b146c3dffca7a45df22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/2/282cf257220cfc0de7647945572e6529c1d4774f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=6$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/c/2bcf069d8a6c65338cedd8d4d727c3dbbc81842b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=9$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, respectively) must not be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or our cubic will have a double root, which it clearly does not (proof here is left to the reader). \n</p><p>Thus, substitution of the coefficients into our discriminant gives that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/f/c9ff00c13e89536d7fd3e7e410a2d18c9b0a7faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$324 \\cdot \\left(\\sum_{\\text{sym}}ab\\right)^2 + 324 \\left(\\sum_{\\text{sym}}ab\\right) \\cdot 162 - 4\\left(\\sum_{\\text{sym}}ab\\right)^3 - 4 \\cdot 18^3 \\cdot 162 - 27 \\cdot 162^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -25px\" width=\"606\" height=\"61\" /> must not be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/0/140f11123ca8e4c0e935bb0a16ff80e92b4616a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{\\text{sym}}ab = n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -25px\" width=\"83\" height=\"45\" />, expanding gives that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/b/9bbf49503d06078400347bb815381eff8492db2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$324n^2 + 52488n - 4n^3 - 3779136 - 708588 = -4n^3 + 324n^2 + 52488n - 4487724$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"636\" height=\"18\" /> is not equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must not be a root of our cubic, so from here we apply the cubic formula to find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is not equal to (approximately) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/0/1b046a39ae288bc7f2ec9bb4fc34d4f6ca04b484.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-115.853202973303$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/c/cbc9d7f7ff3eb5d97ed348b21287a57a983dcf14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$96.4974047104675$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"143\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/6/fa6d638987fb311c8cb3596da20c59a7a789a418.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100.355798262835$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"143\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Recall that, from earlier, our answer is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/0/3e0dd5a627d23d7ab78280a04efa51bdf6777c75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\dfrac13+\\dfrac16+\\dfrac19\\right)(3 + 6 + 9) = \\left(\\dfrac1a+\\dfrac1b+\\dfrac1c\\right)(a+b+c) = \\left(\\dfrac{\\sum_{\\text{sym}}ab}{162}\\right)(18) = \\dfrac{n}{162} \\cdot 18 = \\dfrac{n}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"701\" height=\"47\" />. By bounding, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is between the aforementioned values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/c/cbc9d7f7ff3eb5d97ed348b21287a57a983dcf14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$96.4974047104675$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"143\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/6/fa6d638987fb311c8cb3596da20c59a7a789a418.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100.355798262835$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"143\" height=\"14\" />, so since it must be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (all answers in the Junior Mathematicians' Problem Solving Competition are integers), it is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the requested answer is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a057cf962b6e0da88425b3b68b6c199be04b76a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{99}{9} = \\boxed{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />. This corroborates with jasperE3's strict bounding. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Figure 1:</b> Final diagram from AoPS user <i>awang11</i>:\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:Screen_Shot_2021-07-12_at_10.25.44_AM.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/6/6d/Screen_Shot_2021-07-12_at_10.25.44_AM.png/400px-Screen_Shot_2021-07-12_at_10.25.44_AM.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"298\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/6/6d/Screen_Shot_2021-07-12_at_10.25.44_AM.png/600px-Screen_Shot_2021-07-12_at_10.25.44_AM.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/6/6d/Screen_Shot_2021-07-12_at_10.25.44_AM.png/800px-Screen_Shot_2021-07-12_at_10.25.44_AM.png 2x\" /></a></span></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Sprint Problems\">Other 2021 JMPSC Sprint Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Sprint Answer Key\">2021 JMPSC Sprint Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JMPSC_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"JMPSC Problems and Solutions\">All JMPSC Problems and Solutions</a></li></ol>\n<p>The problems on this page are copyrighted by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://jmpsc.org\">Junior Mathematicians' Problem Solving Competition</a>. <span class=\"mw-valign-middle\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:JMPSC.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/120px-JMPSC.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/180px-JMPSC.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/a/ab/JMPSC.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017054708\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 305/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 183/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 11099/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.953      1 Template:JMPSC_Notice\n100.00%    7.953      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21575:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017054708 and revision id 158225. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}